WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.254
One instructive observation concerns the limits of
unfolding only a couple of moments.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:10.030
After Moment Unfolding matches the first and second
moments of the jet width,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.984
the full distributions of truth and reweighted
generation still are not statistically identical.

00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:21.319
The reason is simply that higher moments remain
relevant and were not part of the fit.

00:00:21.399 --> 00:00:22.931
This is expected behavior,

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:28.575
and it clarifies that the technique deliberately
controls the specific moments you ask for,

00:00:28.655 --> 00:00:29.940
leaving the rest free.
